OL,3,GNEWSAMan found with serious injuries in
OL,4,Aearly hours
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man is being treated in hospital
OL,7,Fafter he was found with serious
OL,8,Finjuries in the early hours.
OL,10,FOfficers were called to Great Western
OL,11,FWay, between Sainsbury's and Hunderton
OL,12,FBridge, in Hereford at about 05:00 BST,
OL,13,Fsaid West Mercia Police.
OL,15,F"The man was taken to hospital where
OL,16,Fhis condition is described as
OL,17,Flife-threatening and we are keeping an
OL,18,Fopen mind around how his injuries were
OL,19,Fcaused," the force added.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
