OL,3,GNEWSAMan found with serious injuries in
OL,4,Aearly hours
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficers have appealed for anyone who
OL,7,Fwitnessed anything in the location
OL,8,Fbetween 02:30 and 05:30 or who has
OL,9,Fother information to call them on 101.
